# Fox Run: an original tune for the chiptune player. A minor, 150 beats a minute, 8 bars of 8 rows.
# One row is an eighth note. Columns: lead (pulse 25%) | harmony (pulse 50%) | bass (triangle) | drums (noise)
# Tokens: note names C4 to B7 with # for sharps (A4 = 440 Hz); - holds the previous note; . is silence.
# Drums: k kick, s snare, h hat; - lets the hit ring out; . is silence.
